menu "P4Key crypto proof"

config P4KEY_CRYPTO_SELFTEST
    bool "Run crypto self tests once at boot"
    default n
    help
        Run bounded accelerator known answer negative and random smoke tests.
        Test names status and timing are logged but crypto values are not.

config P4KEY_CRYPTO_BENCH
    bool "Run crypto benchmarks after self tests"
    depends on P4KEY_CRYPTO_SELFTEST
    default n
    help
        Report minimum operation timing and repetition counts.
        Timing is supporting data and never proves hardware selection.

endmenu
